### Place an order
POST http://localhost:5080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "restaurantId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "couponCode": "SAVE10",
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 80
    }
  ]
}

### Track an order (replace the id with the one returned above)
GET http://localhost:5080/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Cancel an order
POST http://localhost:5080/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel

### Refund a cancelled order
POST http://localhost:5080/api/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/refund

### Get a restaurant
GET http://localhost:5080/api/restaurants/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
